    "caption": "Ready to take your startup to the next level?\n\n🔥 Astana Hub and Draper University are offering an exclusive opportunity for tech startups to immerse themselves in Silicon Valley’s dynamic ecosystem through the HERO TRAINING program. \n\nThere’s still time to apply!\n\n💼 The program includes intensive workshops on business modeling, pitch practices, networking events, and demo days with field experts and venture capital investors.\n\n🌟 This year, 10 of the best startup projects from Kazakhstan, Kyrgyzstan, Uzbekistan, Azerbaijan, Mongolia, Tajikistan, and Turkiye will be selected to participate.\n\n⏳ The application deadline is September 1, 2024.\n\n🔗 Submit your application now through the link in the bio!",
